<h1>Reset your password</h1>
<p>Hi, {{name}}.</p>
<p>We received a request to reset the password for your account. Click the button below to choose a new password:</p>
{{> button url=resetUrl label="Reset password"}}
<p>This link expires in <strong>{{expiresInMinutes}} minutes</strong> and can only be used once.</p>
<p class="muted">If the button does not work, copy and paste this address into your browser:</p>
<p class="muted break-all" style="word-break:break-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:12px;"><a href="{{resetUrl}}" style="word-break:break-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;">{{resetUrl}}</a></p>
<p class="muted">If you did not request a password reset, ignore this email — your password will stay the same.</p>
